/-!
# End-to-End Kernel (`decide +kernel`) Tests for ARiSCA ART v1 Checkers

Exercises both `checkArt_sound` and `checkArtB_sound` via `decide +kernel` on:
1. `UArray4` (4×4 unsigned array multiplier: 268 B AIG, 1116 B ART);
2. `SBooth8Flip` (8×8 signed radix-4 Booth multiplier with 25 FLIP ops: 1587 B AIG, 6388 B ART);
3. Negative test (`u_array_4_drop_art`): dropping the final MAIN op word (and updating `nMain`
   and `total_words`) is rejected (`= false`) by both `checkArt` and `checkArtB`.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace LeanQbeTest.T.AriscaTest

open LeanQbe.T.Examples.Arisca

